chapter8([139],'Manual review required','GPO’s amendment/courtwork punctuation exception can disagree with LCB’s always-inside comma/period preference. Known conflicting choices are excluded from Stylistic Check under the user policy; quotation role still requires review.');
chapter8([148],'Partially automated','Checks the final semicolon before and in explicitly introduced semicolon-separated comma groups of complete recognized figures or nouns, following the LCB grouped-series instruction. Complete introduced groups have no arbitrary source-length cap, with forward lexical discovery and whole introducer/item evidence protected from source strikes including gaps, every table and unknown ignored/excluded fragments. Original Unicode boundaries and identified interior header parts preserve exact conjunction offsets; numerical punctuation cannot truncate establishing evidence. '+GROUPED_SEMICOLON_REVIEW_SCOPE+' General independent clauses without these introduced-group cues remain manual.');
