chapter12([1,2,3,8,12,19,20,21,22,24],'Manual review required','This rule requires publication purpose, typographic treatment, related-expression scope, proper-name or indefinite meaning, complete written-number parsing, or modifier/large-scale semantics. Selected LCB numeral checks do not establish every case. Known LCB/GPO form disagreements are excluded under the user policy.');
chapter12([4,23],'Partially automated','Selected ordinary bill cardinals use words below ten and figures from ten upward, with sentence, identifier, quote and numerical-context guards. Complete canonical counts containing and require a recognized noun and boundary; bare ambiguous series never receive isolated hundred/two corrections. Digest and specialized quantity contexts that disagree with LCB are excluded. Unknown names, hypothetical meanings and uncued numeric roles require review.');
chapter12([5,6],'Partially automated','Selected related count/quantity spreads, expressly introduced pure scalar series and counted lists with recognized noun phrases use figures when one member is ten or larger. Explicit of whom/which/them partitions tie only subject counts to a stated whole with a recognized noun head. Number grouping commas remain inside their values; only leading counts join a counted series, preserving nested time modifiers. Dates, different units and specialized figures do not automatically force every number in the sentence into figures; verb words cannot act as count heads. Complex sentence-level relationships remain manual.');
