chapter12([7],'Partially automated','Selected legal section/article/chapter references, including explicitly labelled alphanumeric/hyphenated serials and nested subdivisions, and explicitly labelled year ranges preserve figures or correct written identifiers. Unlisted serial roles, patents, addresses, phones, biblical and technical citations need review.');
chapter12([9],'Partially automated','Selected dates, grades, percentages, complete explicitly labelled ratios including direct coordinated alternatives and selected education-level qualifiers, and clock forms are checked. Small LCB bill measures/ages/durations and codified monetary conventions can differ from GPO and are excluded where known. The extensive scientific, sports, mathematical and technical examples are not all implemented.');
chapter12([10,11],'Partially automated','Selected bill ordinals and the first-grade exception are checked; conflicting digest ordinal choices are excluded. Canonical large figure ordinals use exact digit strings for grouping and suffixes; no rounded value or invented very large word form is proposed. Juxtaposed ordinal groups, military units, geographical names and specialized serial ordinals need review.');
chapter12([13],'Manual review required','Street numbering requires identifying an actual address and its layout/context, with faithful proper names. No unrestricted ordinal change is applied to street names.');
chapter12([14],'Partially automated',EXACT_QUANTITY_GROUPING_SCOPE);
chapter12([15],'Manual review required','Chemical formula coefficient/subscript position requires reliable typography and scientific parsing. Text extraction alone cannot certify this rule.');
chapter12([16],'Partially automated','Selected figure-starting prose sentences are spelled out or require rephrasing; recognized integer SI quantities also expand the unit name. Headers, citations and source quotations are protected. Arbitrary layouts, technical subjects and all sentence segmentation remain incomplete. '+DECIMAL_OPENING_REVIEW_SCOPE+' '+FRACTION_OPENING_REVIEW_SCOPE+' '+LARGE_INTEGER_OPENING_REVIEW_SCOPE+' '+ORDINARY_INTEGER_OPENING_REVIEW_SCOPE);
chapter12([17],'Manual review required','Verbatim testimony, speaker labels and Q./A. roles require reliable document-context recognition. This legislative-bill checker does not impose transcript exceptions on ordinary prose.');
chapter12([18],'Partially automated','Selected recognized codified monetary provisions check paired words/figures and matching values; findings, resolutions and digest have distinct LCB forms. General requested double forms, all currencies and ambiguous legal contexts remain manual.');
chapter12([26],'Partially automated','Selected standalone simple bill fractions and written hyphenation are checked. Ordinary nonopening LCB digest forms and small mixed bill durations disagree with GPO and are excluded. General mixed counts, replacement wording for very large denominators and complete semantic fraction context remain manual. '+FRACTION_OPENING_REVIEW_SCOPE);
chapter12([27],'Manual review required','Fraction notation depends on copy request, built-up versus full-sized type and exact typography. No blanket slash, glyph or fraction-stack conversion is performed.');
chapter12([28],'Manual review required','GPO fraction unit-modifier choices can disagree with LCB written bill fractions and are excluded where recognized. Arbitrary technical unit-modifier classification and source notation require review.');
chapter12([25],'Partially automated','Selected closely related numbers following a sentence-opening number within three intervening words are recognized as a GPO/LCB form disagreement and excluded. The first sentence-opening figure remains checked where both guides agree; longer or complex relationships require review.');
chapter12([29],'Manual review required','The Roman-numeral value table is reference information. Semantic numeral roles, overbar multipliers and authentic titles require review; no blanket replacement is applied.');
