chapter13([3,...seq(14,28),...seq(57,64),...seq(89,93),...seq(102,108),116,117,118,119,121,122],'Manual review required','Table rules, bearoffs, column/boxhead type and alignment, indentation, continued or parallel layout and figure placement require reliable table structure and PDF geometry. Existing rendering preserves source layout; it does not certify or automatically correct every table convention.');
