chapter13([114,115,120,123],'Manual review required','Symbol/figure-column roles, stub unit labels and quotation marks in table matter require identifying table structure, actual data units, source extraction boundaries and font/layout conventions. These examples remain searchable; full automatic verification is not implemented.');
